    {
      "index": 23,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_日常",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "No, no. I just left here for college, so I’ve fallen a bit out of touch with what’s been going on lately.",
        "zh": "不是不是，我只是大学离开了这里，对近况有些脱节了。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "name": {
        "en": "Mom",
        "zh": "男孩母亲",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/IMG_5819",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Oh, then you picked the perfect time to come back. Lucky you!",
        "zh": "哎呀，这样正好赶上才叫幸运呢！回来玩的开心哦！",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_疑惑",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "Huh?",
        "zh": "欸？",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "name": {
        "en": "Mom",
        "zh": "男孩母亲",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/IMG_5819",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "You didn’t know? Then be extra careful over the next few days.",
        "zh": "没有吗，那这几天一定要注意安全哦。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_日常",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "Thank you. I will.",
        "zh": "谢谢您，我会小心的。",
        "ja": ""
      },
