    {
      "index": 28,
      "name": {
        "en": "Mom",
        "zh": "男孩母亲",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/IMG_5819",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Probably about half a month ago. Since then, people from ”Troupe Elysium“ have been promoting it all over the city.",
        "zh": "从大概半个月前开始吧，芸台市里“极乐戏团”成员的人一直在市区各种地方进行宣传。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "name": {
        "en": "Mom",
        "zh": "男孩母亲",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/IMG_5819",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "One day after school, we ran into them handing out free merch on the street. He really liked one of the puppets.",
        "zh": "我带这孩子放学回家的时候，正好碰上他们在路边发放免费的周边，这孩子特别喜欢其中的木偶。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 0
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "name": {
        "en": "Mom",
        "zh": "男孩母亲",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/IMG_5819",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "I’ve seen them around, handing out merch and giving talks on the street, but all the members I’ve come across were <color=orange>wearing masks and those long cloaks with hoods</color>.",
        "zh": "虽然经常能见到他们的成员在路边发放周边和进行宣讲活动，但是我见过的所有成员都<color=orange>带着面具，穿着带有兜帽的长袍</color>。",
